            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The module describes the primary production of lead in Europe. The multi-output-process "smelting, primary lead production" delivers the co-products "lead, primary, at plant" and "parkes process crust, from desilverising of lead". The flow "lead, …" is part of the respective European supply mix. The by-product "parkes process crust, …" receives part of the burden and enters the silver production chain.;
